---

<Layout
  title="AI Mortgage Admin — More cases submitted. Less time lost to admin."
  description="Upload the case. AI Mortgage Admin reviews the file and drafts the client chase for whatever is missing."
  ogTitle="AI Mortgage Admin — More cases submitted. Less time lost to admin."
  ogDescription="Upload the case. AI Mortgage Admin reviews the file and drafts the client chase for whatever is missing."
  includeHomeStyles={false}
>

<div class="scroll-progress"></div>
<a class="float-cta" href="#book"><span class="dot"></span>Book a call<span class="arrow">→</span></a>

<!-- NAV -->
<header class="wrap">
  <nav class="nav">
    <a class="nav-brand" href="#">
      <img src="/images/the-claws-logo.svg" alt="TheClaws" class="nav-brand-logo" />
      <span>AI Mortgage Admin</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#problem">Problem</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#case">Case study</a>
      <a href="#incl">Included</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" href="#book">Book a call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
  </nav>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO (all above fold) ============ -->
<section class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="dot"></span>Documents processed in <span class="counter" data-count="8" data-suffix=" minutes">8 minutes</span>, not hours</div>
    <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">More cases submitted.<br><span class="mark">Less time lost to admin.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub reveal reveal-delay-2">Upload the case. AI Mortgage Admin reviews the file and drafts the client chase for whatever is missing.</p>
    <div class="btns reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <a class="btn btn-lime btn-magnet" href="#book">Book a call &amp; see it on your file <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <p class="micro reveal reveal-delay-4">On the call we review one of your live cases and show you the gaps it would flag before submission. No prep needed. Bring the file.</p>

    <hr class="hero-divider reveal reveal-delay-4">

    <div class="hero-caps reveal reveal-delay-5">
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13"></line><line x1="8" y1="17" x2="16" y2="17"></line></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Reads the whole file</strong>
        <span>Bank statements, credit file, payslips, deposit source, protection notes.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Drafts the chase</strong>
        <span>Written from the actual file. You review before sending.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Fits your firm's rules</strong>
        <span>Your compliance wording, your network, your tone.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-stage">
    <img class="agent" src="/images/hero-ai-mortgage-admin.webp" alt="AI Mortgage Admin reviewing a case file">
    <div class="sbubble"><span class="spark"></span> What needs attention on case #2847?</div>

    <!-- Missing items -->
    <div class="fcard fcard-alert">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic">!</span>
        <span>Missing items flagged</span>
        <span class="pill">4</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chip-list">
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Payslip</b> · March</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Bank statement</b> · p.4</span></div>
