        <p>Compares declared commitments against loans, cards, car finance, missed payments, defaults, CCJs, hard searches and active balances. Nothing the client "forgot to mention" surprises you later.</p>
        <div class="saves">
          <span class="slbl">What it saves you</span>
          <span class="svalue">Prevents submission delays — stops avoidable declines, queries and back-and-forth.</span>
